unication tone.\n\nCandidate C: makes correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, regarded as egocentric, not willing to further education, 100% reliable, excellent attention skills. Strengths: decision quality, reliability, attention. Concerns: communication, egocentric, lack of development.\n\nCandidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, concentrates very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, regarded as arrogant, regarded as a loner. Strengths: adaptability, concentration, problem solving, responsibility. Concerns: arrogance, loner (crew cooperation).\n\nWe need to pick best overall fit. Likely candidate B or C? B has stress handling, conscientiousness, but communication tone issues. C has decision quality, reliability, attention, but communication difficulty and egocentric, not willing to develop. D has problem solving, responsibility, but arrogance and loner may affect crew cooperation. A has anticipation and leadership but health and criticism issues.\n\nWhich candidate best balances? Probably Candidate B: strong reliability, stress resilience, technical (weather), but communication tone could be mitigated. However, C's decision speed and reliability are strong, but egocentric and communication issues may be severe for crew. D's arrogance and loner may be big risk for crew cooperation. A's health and criticism issues may affect long flights.\n\nThus I might recommend Candidate B. Provide evidence: conscientiousness (operational reliability), handles stress well (stress resilience), good weather assessment (technical competence). Acknowledge concerns: grumpy, tone, but can be coached.\n\nMake vote Candidate B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
